        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: City University, Malaysia; Southern Cross University; Economic Planning Unit; Prime Minister's Department (Malaysia); Commonwealth Secretariat; United Nations\n- People: Professor A. Selvanathan\n- Roles: Head of research; Director; Advisor; Professor\n- Places: Malaysia; Australia; Lismore; Coffs Harbour; northern New South Wales; Gold Coast; Queensland\n\nFacts:\n- Professor A. Selvanathan is the head of research at City University, Malaysia.\n- Professor A. Selvanathan served as Director of the Economic Planning Unit of the Prime Minister's Department in Malaysia.\n- Professor A. Selvanathan served as Director of the Commonwealth Secretariat.\n- Professor A. Selvanathan served as an Advisor to the United Nations.\n- Professor A. Selvanathan served as a Professor at Southern Cross University.\n- Southern Cross University is an Australian public university.\n- Southern Cross University has campuses at Lismore and Coffs Harbour in northern New South Wales.\n- Southern Cross University has a campus at the southern end of the Gold Coast in Queensland.",
